{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "on them"}, {"text": "صَلَوَٰتٌۭ", "translation": "(are) blessings"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّهِمْ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَرَحْمَةٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "and Mercy"}, {"text": "وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "And those"}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "[they]"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُهْتَدُونَ", "translation": "(are) the guided ones"}], "sahih": "Those are the ones upon whom are blessings from their Lord and mercy. And it is those who are the [rightly] guided."}